School Info
66	Description	Las Palmas Christian School is a mission-minded bilingual school committed to educating and equipping students with academic excellence grounded in a Biblical worldview. Our vision is to challenge students to grow as servant leaders and inspire them to become agents of positive change in their communities and beyond. Our unique bilingual model allows students to learn in both English and Spanish every day. English-speaking teachers lead instruction in English Language Arts, Math, and Science, while Dominican teachers provide instruction in Spanish language, Social Studies, and foundational Bible classes. This daily immersion enables students to develop strong communication skills, cultural awareness, and confidence in two languages. More than an academic institution, Las Palmas is a ministry that uses education as a tool for Kingdom impact. Teachers are not only educators but also mentors who invest spiritually and relationally in the lives of students and families. Through meaningful relationships, discipleship, and high expectations, our faculty help shape young people who are prepared to serve God and lead with integrity. Serving at Las Palmas offers the opportunity to grow professionally, live missionally, and make an eternal difference. If you desire to use your teaching gifts in a cross-cultural environment where faith and learning are intentionally integrated, we invite you to consider joining our team.
