Vision Trip Description
67	Vision Trip Description	Once you have secured your flight to the Dominican Republic, we will gladly host you for up to 4 days by providing lodging, meals, and transportation. During this time, you will have the opportunity to visit and experience the various ministries that make up the DR Vision, allowing you to prayerfully explore how God may be leading you to serve.
